text:
Here's a complete, single-file Workout Tracker web app with a modern UI, local storage persistence, and rich features:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>💪 Workout Tracker</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0f0f13;
    --card: #1a1a24;
    --card-hover: #22222f;
    --accent: #6c5ce7;
    --accent-light: #a29bfe;
    --green: #00b894;
    --red: #e17055;
    --orange: #fdcb6e;
    --text: #f0f0f5;
    --text-dim: #8888a0;
    --border: #2a2a3a;
    --radius: 14px;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-bottom: 90px;
  }

  header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c5ce7 0%, #4834d4 100%);
    padding: 28px 20px 22px;
    text-align: center;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(108,92,231,0.3);
  }
  header h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
  header p { font-size: 0.82rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-top: 4px; }

  .container { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px; }

  /* ---- Stats Row ---- */
  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 14px 10px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .stat-card .num {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light), var(--green));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .stat-card .label { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }

  /* ---- Tabs ---- */
  .tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 5px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .tab {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .tab.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(108,92,231,0.4);
  }

  /* ---- Panels ---- */
  .panel { display: none; }
  .panel.active { display: block; animation: fadeIn 0.25s; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

  /* ---- Form ---- */
  .form-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .form-card h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }

  .field { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .field label { display: block; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .field input, .field select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: border 0.2s;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .field select option { background: var(--bg); }

  .row { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
  .row .field { flex: 1; }

  /* ---- Exercise List in Form ---- */
  .exercise-list { margin-top: 10px; }
  .exercise-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .exercise-item .details { flex: 1; }
  .exercise-item .details strong { color: var(--accent-light); }
  .exercise-item .meta { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.78rem; margin-top: 2px; }
  .exercise-item .remove-ex {
    background: none; border: none; color: var(--red); font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; padding: 4px 8px;
  }

  .btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-accent {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c5ce7, #4834d4);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(108,92,231,0.3);
  }
  .btn-accent:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(108,92,231,0.4); }
  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-light);
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .btn-green {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00b894, #00a381);
    color: #fff;
    margin-top: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,184,148,0.3);
  }
  .btn-green:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

  /* ---- History ---- */
  .workout-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .workout-card:hover { background: var(--card-hover); }
  .workout-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .workout-header h3 { font-size: 1rem; }
  .workout-date { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-dim); }
  .workout-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .badge-strength { background: rgba(108,92,231,0.2); color: var(--accent-light); }
  .badge-cardio { background: rgba(0,184,148,0.2); color: var(--green); }
  .badge-flex { background: rgba(253,203,110,0.2); color: var(--orange); }

  .exercise-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 7px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .exercise-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .exercise-row .name { flex: 1; }
  .exercise-row .info { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: right; }

  .workout-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding-top: 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .workout-footer .duration { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); }
  .delete-btn {
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--red);
    color: var(--red);
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .delete-btn:hover { background: var(--red); color: #fff; }

  .empty-state {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 50px 20px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .empty-state .icon { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .empty-state p { font-size: 0.9rem; }

  /* ---- Charts Panel ---- */
  .chart-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .chart-card h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .bar-chart { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 6px; height: 120px; padding-top: 10px; }
  .bar-col { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; height: 100%; }
  .bar {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 36px;
    border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-light), var(--accent));
    transition: height 0.4s;
    min-height: 2px;
  }
  .bar-label { font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: 6px; }
  .bar-val { font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 4px; }

  .streak-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .streak-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .streak-row .val { font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-light); }

  /* ---- Timer ---- */
  .timer-section {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .timer-display {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    margin: 10px 0 16px;
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }
  .timer-btns { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
  .timer-btns .btn { flex: 1; padding: 12px; }

  /* ---- Toasts ---- */
  .toast {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 100px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
    background: var(--green);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    z-index: 200;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }

  /* ---- Muscle group pills ---- */
  .muscle-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .pill {
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .pill.active { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-color: var(--accent); }

  /* ---- Responsive ---- */
  @media (max-width: 400px) {
    .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; }
    .stat-card { padding: 10px 6px; }
    .stat-card .num { font-size: 1.3rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>💪 Workout Tracker</h1>
  <p id="headerDate"></p>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <!-- Stats -->
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="num" id="statTotal">0</div>
      <div class="label">Workouts</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="num" id="statWeek">0</div>
      <div class="label">This Week</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="num" id="statStreak">0</div>
      <div class="label">Day Streak</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Tabs -->
  <div class="tabs">
    <div class="tab active" data-tab="log">＋ Log</div>
    <div class="tab" data-tab="history">📋 History</div>
    <div class="tab" data-tab="charts">📊 Stats</div>
  </div>

  <!-- LOG PANEL -->
  <div class="panel active" id="panel-log">
    <!-- Rest Timer -->
    <div class="timer-section">
      <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-dim);">⏱ Rest Timer</div>
      <div class="timer-display" id="timerDisplay">0:00</div>
      <div class="timer-btns">
        <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="setTimer(60)">1:00</button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="setTimer(90)">1:30</button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="setTimer(120)">2:00</button>
        <button class="btn btn-accent" id="timerToggle" onclick="toggleTimer()">Start</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-card">
      <h2>🏋️ New Workout</h2>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Workout Type</label>
        <select id="workoutType">
          <option value="Strength">🏋️ Strength</option>
          <option value="Cardio">🏃 Cardio</option>
          <option value="Flexibility">🧘 Flexibility</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Duration (minutes)</label>
        <input type="number" id="duration" placeholder="e.g. 45" min="1">
      </div>

      <hr style="border-color:var(--border); margin: 16px 0;">
      <h3 style="font-size:0.92rem; margin-bottom:12px;">Add Exercises</h3>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Muscle Group</label>
        <div class="muscle-pills" id="musclePills">
          <div class="pill active" data-mg="All">All</div>
          <div class="pill" data-mg="Chest">Chest</div>
          <div class="pill" data-mg="Back">Back</div>
          <div class="pill" data-mg="Legs">Legs</div>
          <div class="pill" data-mg="Shoulders">Shoulders</div>
          <div class="pill" data-mg="Arms">Arms</div>
          <div class="pill" data-mg="Core">Core</div>
          <div class="pill" data-mg="Cardio">Cardio</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Exercise</label>
        <select id="exerciseName">
          <option value="">Select exercise...</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Or type custom exercise</label>
        <input type="text" id="customExercise" placeholder="e.g. Cable Flyes">
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Sets</label>
          <input type="number" id="sets" placeholder="3" min="1">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Reps</label>
          <input type="number" id="reps" placeholder="10" min="1">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Weight</label>
          <input type="number" id="weight" placeholder="lbs" min="0">
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="addExercise()">＋ Add Exercise</button>

      <div class="exercise-list" id="exerciseList"></div>

      <button class="btn btn-green" onclick="saveWorkout()">✅ Save Workout</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- HISTORY PANEL -->
  <div class="panel" id="panel-history">
    <div id="historyList"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- CHARTS PANEL -->
  <div class="panel" id="panel-charts">
    <div class="chart-card">
      <h3>📅 Workouts Per Week (Last 8 Weeks)</h3>
      <div class="bar-chart" id="weeklyChart"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-card">
      <h3>🏆 Personal Records</h3>
      <div id="prList"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-card">
      <h3>📈 Overview</h3>
      <div id="overviewStats"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<script>
  // ===== DATA =====
  const EXERCISES = {
    Chest: ['Bench Press','Incline Bench Press','Dumbbell Flyes','Push-Ups','Cable Crossover','Chest Dips','Decline Bench Press'],
    Back: ['Deadlift','Pull-Ups','Barbell Row','Lat Pulldown','Seated Cable Row','T-Bar Row','Face Pulls'],
    Legs: ['Squat','Leg Press','Romanian Deadlift','Lunges','Leg Curl','Leg Extension','Calf Raises','Hip Thrust'],
    Shoulders: ['Overhead Press','Lateral Raise','Front Raise','Arnold Press','Reverse Flyes','Shrugs'],
    Arms: ['Barbell Curl','Hammer Curl','Tricep Pushdown','Skull Crushers','Concentration Curl','Dips','Preacher Curl'],
    Core: ['Plank','Crunches','Leg Raises','Russian Twist','Ab Wheel','Cable Crunch','Hanging Knee Raise'],
    Cardio: ['Running','Cycling','Rowing','Jump Rope','Elliptical','Stair Climber','Swimming','HIIT']
  };

  let currentExercises = [];
  let workouts = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('workouts') || '[]');

  // ===== INIT =====
  document.getElementById('headerDate').textContent = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { weekday:'long', year:'numeric', month:'long', day:'numeric' });
  populateExerciseSelect('All');
  updateStats();

  // ===== TABS =====
  document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(tab => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
      document.querySelectorAll('.panel').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));
      tab.classList.add('active');
      document.getElementById('panel-' + tab.dataset.tab).classList.add('active');
      if (tab.dataset.tab === 'history') renderHistory();
      if (tab.dataset.tab === 'charts') renderCharts();
    });
  });

  // ===== MUSCLE PILLS =====
  document.querySelectorAll('.pill').forEach(pill => {
    pill.addEventListener('click', () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('.pill').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));
      pill.classList.add('active');
      populateExerciseSelect(pill.dataset.mg);
    });
  });

  function populateExerciseSelect(group) {
    const sel = document.getElementById('exerciseName');
    sel.innerHTML = '<option value="">Select exercise...</option>';
    let list = [];
    if (group === 'All') {
      Object.values(EXERCISES).forEach(arr => list.push(...arr));
    } else {
      list = EXERCISES[group] || [];
    }
    list.sort().forEach(ex => {
      const o = document.createElement('option');
      o.value = ex; o.textContent = ex;
      sel.appendChild(o);
    });
  }

  // ===== ADD EXERCISE =====
  function addExercise() {
    const name = document.getElementById('customExercise').value.trim() || document.getElementById('exerciseName').value;
    const sets = parseInt(document.getElementById('sets').value) || 0;
    const reps = parseInt(document.getElementById('reps').value) || 0;
    const weight = parseFloat(document.getElementById('weight').value) || 0;

    if (!name) return toast('Please select or type an exercise', true);
    if (!sets && !reps) return toast('Please enter sets and reps', true);

    currentExercises.push({ name, sets, reps, weight });
    renderExerciseList();
    document.getElementById('customExercise').value = '';
    document.getElementById('sets').value = '';
    document.getElementById('reps').value = '';
    document.getElementById('weight').value = '';
    toast('Exercise added!');
  }

  function renderExerciseList() {
    const el = document.getElementById('exerciseList');
    el.innerHTML = currentExercises.map((ex, i) => `
      <div class="exercise-item">
        <div class="details">
          <strong>${ex.name}</strong>
          <div class="meta">${ex.sets} sets × ${ex.reps} reps${ex.weight ? ' @ ' + ex.weight + ' lbs' : ''}</div>
        </div>
        <button class="remove-ex" onclick="removeExercise(${i})">✕</button>
      </div>
    `).join('');
  }

  function removeExercise(i) {
    currentExercises.splice(i, 1);
    renderExerciseList();
  }

  // ===== SAVE WORKOUT =====
  function saveWorkout() {
    if (currentExercises.length === 0) return toast('Add at least one exercise!', true);
    const duration = parseInt(document.getElementById('duration').value) || 0;
    const type = document.getElementById('workoutType').value;

    const workout = {
      id: Date.now(),
      date: new Date().toISOString(),
      type,
      duration,
      exercises: [...currentExercises]
    };

    workouts.unshift(workout);
    localStorage.setItem('workouts', JSON.stringify(workouts));
    currentExercises = [];
    renderExerciseList();
    document.getElementById('duration').value = '';
    updateStats();
    toast('Workout saved! 💪');
  }

  // ===== HISTORY =====
  function renderHistory() {
    const el = document.getElementById('historyList');
    if (workouts.length === 0) {
      el.innerHTML = '<div class="empty-state"><div class="icon">🏋️</div><p>No workouts yet.<br>Log your first workout!</p></div>';
      return;
    }
    el.innerHTML = workouts.map(w => {
      const d = new Date(w.date);
      const dateStr = d.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { weekday:'short', month:'short', day:'numeric' });
      const timeStr = d.toLocaleTimeString('en-US', { hour:'numeric', minute:'2-digit' });
      const badgeClass = w.type === 'Strength' ? 'badge-strength' : w.type === 'Cardio' ? 'badge-cardio' : 'badge-flex';
      return `
        <div class="workout-card">
          <div class="workout-header">
            <div>
              <h3>${dateStr}</h3>
              <div class="workout-date">${timeStr}</div>
            </div>
            <span class="workout-badge ${badgeClass}">${w.type}</span>
          </div>
          ${w.exercises.map(ex => `
            <div class="exercise-row">
              <span class="name">${ex.name}</span>
              <span class="info">${ex.sets}×${ex.reps}${ex.weight ? ' • ' + ex.weight + 'lbs' : ''}</span>
            </div>
          `).join('')}
          <div class="workout-footer">
            <span class="duration">${w.duration ? '⏱ ' + w.duration + ' min' : ''}</span>
            <button class="delete-btn" onclick="deleteWorkout(${w.id})">Delete</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      `;
    }).join('');
  }

  function deleteWorkout(id) {
    if (!confirm('Delete this workout?')) return;
    workouts = workouts.filter(w => w.id !== id);
    localStorage.setItem('workouts', JSON.stringify(workouts));
    renderHistory();
    updateStats();
    toast('Workout deleted');
  }

  // ===== STATS =====
  function updateStats() {
    document.getElementById('statTotal').textContent = workouts.length;

    const now = new Date();
    const weekAgo = new Date(now); weekAgo.setDate(now.getDate() - 7);
    const thisWeek = workouts.filter(w => new Date(w.date) >= weekAgo).length;
    document.getElementById('statWeek').textContent = thisWeek;

    // Streak
    let streak = 0;
    const today = new Date(); today.setHours(0,0,0,0);
    let check = new Date(today);
    // Check if today has a workout, if not start from yesterday
    const hasTodayWorkout = workouts.some(w => {
      const wd = new Date(w.date); wd.setHours(0,0,0,0);
      return wd.getTime() === check.getTime();
    });
    if (!hasTodayWorkout) check.setDate(check.getDate() - 1);

    while (true) {
      const hasWorkout = workouts.some(w => {
        const wd = new Date(w.date); wd.setHours(0,0,0,0);
        return wd.getTime() === check.getTime();
      });
      if (hasWorkout) { streak++; check.setDate(check.getDate() - 1); }
      else break;
    }
    document.getElementById('statStreak').textContent = streak;
  }

  // ===== CHARTS =====
  function renderCharts() {
    // Weekly chart
    const chart = document.getElementById('weeklyChart');
    const weeks = [];
    for (let i = 7; i >= 0; i--) {
      const end = new Date(); end.setDate(end.getDate() - i * 7); end.setHours(23,59,59);
      const start = new Date(end); start.setDate(start.getDate() - 6); start.setHours(0,0,0,0);
      const count = workouts.filter(w => { const d = new Date(w.date); return d >= start && d <= end; }).length;
      const label = start.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month:'short', day:'numeric' });
      weeks.push({ label, count });
    }
    const maxW = Math.max(...weeks.map(w => w.count), 1);
    chart.innerHTML = weeks.map(w => `
      <div class="bar-col">
        <div class="bar-val">${w.count}</div>
        <div class="bar" style="height:${(w.count / maxW) * 100}%"></div>
        <div class="bar-label">${w.label}</div>
      </div>
    `).join('');

    // Personal records
    const pr = {};
    workouts.forEach(w => {
      w.exercises.forEach(ex => {
        if (ex.weight > 0) {
          if (!pr[ex.name] || ex.weight > pr[ex.name]) pr[ex.name] = ex.weight;
        }
      });
    });
    const prEl = document.getElementById('prList');
    const prEntries = Object.entries(pr).sort((a,b) => b[1] - a[1]);
    if (prEntries.length === 0) {
      prEl.innerHTML = '<div style="color:var(--text-dim); font-size:0.88rem; padding:10px 0;">No weighted exercises logged yet.</div>';
    } else {
      prEl.innerHTML = prEntries.slice(0, 10).map(([name, w]) => `
        <div class="streak-row">
          <span>${name}</span>
          <span class="val">${w} lbs</span>
        </div>
      `).join('');
    }

    // Overview
    const totalDuration = workouts.reduce((s, w) => s + (w.duration || 0), 0);
    const totalSets = workouts.reduce((s, w) => s + w.exercises.reduce((ss, ex) => ss + (ex.sets || 0), 0), 0);
    const totalReps = workouts.reduce((s, w) => s + w.exercises.reduce((ss, ex) => ss + ((ex.sets || 0) * (ex.reps || 0)), 0), 0);
    const totalWeight = workouts.reduce((s, w) => s + w.exercises.reduce((ss, ex) => ss + ((ex.sets || 0) * (ex.reps || 0) * (ex.weight || 0)), 0), 0);
    const overview = document.getElementById('overviewStats');
    overview.innerHTML = `
      <div class="streak-row"><span>Total Time</span><span class="val">${totalDuration} min</span></div>
      <div class="streak-row"><span>Total Sets</span><span class="val">${totalSets.toLocaleString()}</span></div>
      <div class="streak-row"><span>Total Reps</span><span class="val">${totalReps.toLocaleString()}</span></div>
      <div class="streak-row"><span>Volume Lifted</span><span class="val">${totalWeight.toLocaleString()} lbs</span></div>
      <div class="streak-row"><span>Unique Exercises</span><span class="val">${new Set(workouts.flatMap(w => w.exercises.map(e => e.name))).size}</span></div>
    `;
  }

  // ===== REST TIMER =====
  let timerInterval = null;
  let timerSeconds = 0;
  let timerRunning = false;

  function setTimer(s) {
    timerSeconds = s;
    timerRunning = false;
    clearInterval(timerInterval);
    updateTimerDisplay();
    document.getElementById('timerToggle').textContent = 'Start';
  }

  function toggleTimer() {
    if (timerRunning) {
      clearInterval(timerInterval);
      timerRunning = false;
      document.getElementById('timerToggle').textContent = 'Start';
    } else {
      if (timerSeconds <= 0) timerSeconds = 90;
      timerRunning = true;
      document.getElementById('timerToggle').textContent = 'Pause';
      timerInterval = setInterval(() => {
        timerSeconds--;
        updateTimerDisplay();
        if (timerSeconds <= 0) {
          clearInterval(timerInterval);
          timerRunning = false;
          document.getElementById('timerToggle').textContent = 'Start';
          toast('⏰ Rest time is up!');
          if ('vibrate' in navigator) navigator.vibrate([200, 100, 200]);
        }
      }, 1000);
    }
  }

  function updateTimerDisplay() {
    const m = Math.floor(timerSeconds / 60);
    const s = timerSeconds % 60;
    document.getElementById('timerDisplay').textContent = `${m}:${s.toString().padStart(2, '0')}`;
  }

  // ===== TOAST =====
  function toast(msg, isError) {
    const el = document.getElementById('toast');
    el.textContent = msg;
    el.style.background = isError ? 'var(--red)' : 'var(--green)';
    el.classList.add('show');
    setTimeout(() => el.classList.remove('show'), 2200);
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
```

## Features included:

- **📊 Dashboard Stats** — Total workouts, this week's count, and current day streak
- **🏋️ Log Workouts** — Pick a workout type (Strength / Cardio / Flexibility), add multiple exercises with sets, reps, and weight
- **💡 Exercise Library** — 50+ pre-loaded exercises sorted by muscle group (Chest, Back, Legs, Shoulders, Arms, Core, Cardio), plus a custom exercise option
- **⏱ Rest Timer** — Built-in countdown timer with 1:00 / 1:30 / 2:00 presets and vibration alert
- **📋 Workout History** — View all past workouts with exercise details; delete any workout
- **📈 Stats & Charts** — Weekly workout bar chart, personal records (heaviest lifts), and lifetime totals (volume, sets, reps, time)
- **💾 Persistent Storage** — All data saved to `localStorage` so nothing is lost on refresh
- **📱 Mobile-friendly** — Dark theme, responsive design, works great on phones

Just save the file and open it in any browser!

